{"page":76,"title":"一起玩、吟唱与做客礼仪","blocks":[{"title":"Read and talk","kind":"dialogue","lines":[{"en":"Read and talk.","zh":"读一读，说一说。","targetId":"p76-line-0-0","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-8e3a0c6ba9748d3cef83.mp3"},{"en":"Let's play together!","zh":"我们一起玩吧！","targetId":"p76-line-0-1","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-f930edb64a435acc1557.mp3"},{"en":"OK!","zh":"好的！","targetId":"p76-line-0-2","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-c79a4f748fb9d3b7d944.mp3"},{"en":"What's this?","zh":"这是什么？","targetId":"p76-line-0-3","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-ddfd032cce17828b78f3.mp3"},{"en":"It's a bear.","zh":"这是一只熊。","targetId":"p76-line-0-4","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-87e607f26d65a98d2e9c.mp3"},{"en":"Is that a tiger?","zh":"那是一只老虎吗？","targetId":"p76-line-0-5","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-9aba12c38cb63d57f50d.mp3"},{"en":"No, it's a lion.","zh":"不，是一只狮子。","targetId":"p76-line-0-6","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-38f1d095fc87b6d94d71.mp3"},{"en":"Wow! We have a zoo!","zh":"哇！我们有一个动物园！","targetId":"p76-line-0-7","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-34bb6d3be7526b254e61.mp3"},{"en":"Shh ...","zh":"嘘……","targetId":"p76-line-0-8","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-800df372ec476410aec3.mp3"},{"en":"Why does Chen Jie say \"Shh ...\"?","zh":"陈杰为什么说“嘘……”？","targetId":"p76-line-0-9","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-5526376bebc3ffb784ff.mp3"}]},{"title":"Listen and chant","kind":"chant","lines":[{"en":"Listen and chant.","zh":"听一听，吟唱。","targetId":"p76-line-1-0","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-b9be2a4a900c9c3249bf.mp3"},{"en":"Being a good guest","zh":"做一位好客人","targetId":"p76-line-1-1","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-39b86357e840165ccccb.mp3"},{"en":"Say \"Hello!\" or say \"Hi!\"","zh":"说“你好！”或说“嗨！”","targetId":"p76-line-1-2","speakable":true,"audio":"/english/audio/sentence-20998